**Removing Duplicate Values from an Array in JavaScript**
===========================================================

Here's a simple JavaScript function that removes duplicate values from an array. This function uses the `Set` data structure to keep track of unique values.

```javascript
/**
 * Removes duplicate values from an array.
 *
 * @param {Array} arr - The input array.
 * @returns {Array} A new array with duplicate values removed.
 */
function removeDuplicates(arr) {
  return [...new Set(arr)];
}

